{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassTheory.QuantumDilogarithmStratified","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassTheory.QuantumDilogarithmStratified","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.Finset.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Finset.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.partial_product_truncation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.partial_product_truncation","kind":"theorem","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/quantum-dilogarithm-stratified.lean#L85-L94","doc":"Depth-orthogonality at NF-support depth k★(T_w): partial products\nabove k★(T_w) all give the same value (the analytic Φ_q evaluation\ntruncates to the categorical k★ truncation under Frobenius\npairing with T_w). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.partialProductPairing","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.partialProductPairing","kind":"def","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/quantum-dilogarithm-stratified.lean#L76-L83","doc":"The partial product Φ_q^[≤N](z_i) corresponds to truncatedPairing\nM N. The key statement of the stratified proposition is that this\npartial product captures exactly the depth-≤N strata of the\nFrobenius-dual decomposition. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.phi_q_frobenius_truncation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.phi_q_frobenius_truncation","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/quantum-dilogarithm-stratified.lean#L49-L74","doc":"**Frobenius truncation theorem.** For any N ≥ k★(T_w), the\ntruncated pairing equals the k★(T_w)-truncated pairing. This is\nthe Lean-formalised corollary of `conj:quantum-dilogarithm-stratified`:\nreplacing Φ_q(z_i) by its k★(T_w)-truncation in the Frobenius\npairing with T_w gives the same result. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:quantum-dilogarithm-stratified","label":"conj:quantum-dilogarithm-stratified","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/quantum-dilogarithm-stratified.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.truncatedPairing","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.truncatedPairing","kind":"def","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/quantum-dilogarithm-stratified.lean#L42-L47","doc":"The truncated brane-tower Frobenius pairing:\nΣ_{k ≤ N} pairing k. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.DepthGradedFrobeniusModule.vanish_above_kstar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.DepthGradedFrobeniusModule.vanish_above_kstar","kind":"theorem","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/quantum-dilogarithm-stratified.lean#L40-L40","doc":"Frobenius-orthogonality: pairing vanishes for depths > k★(T_w). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.DepthGradedFrobeniusModule.k_star","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.DepthGradedFrobeniusModule.k_star","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/quantum-dilogarithm-stratified.lean#L37-L37","doc":"The NF-support depth k★(T_w). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.DepthGradedFrobeniusModule.pairing","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.DepthGradedFrobeniusModule.pairing","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/quantum-dilogarithm-stratified.lean#L35-L35","doc":"The pairing of phi_at_depth k i with T_w. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.DepthGradedFrobeniusModule.phi_at_depth","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.DepthGradedFrobeniusModule.phi_at_depth","kind":"def","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/quantum-dilogarithm-stratified.lean#L33-L33","doc":"The depth-k Frobenius-dual coefficient (a function of the\nexceptional divisor index i). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.DepthGradedFrobeniusModule.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.DepthGradedFrobeniusModule.mk","kind":"ctor","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/quantum-dilogarithm-stratified.lean#L30-L30","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.DepthGradedFrobeniusModule","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.DepthGradedFrobeniusModule","kind":"structure","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/quantum-dilogarithm-stratified.lean#L26-L40","doc":"A depth-graded R-module with Frobenius pairing: the centre Z(A) of\na Hecke algebra, with GB-depth grading and Frobenius-orthogonality\nof strata at depths j ≠ k★(T_w) under the T_w-pairing. ","signatureChunk":0}]}